# Build output, and the finished program.
#
# build/ is what the compiler leaves behind. dist/ is what comes out of it:
# the exe and the runtime beside it. Neither belongs in the repository, and
# dist/ is roughly two hundred megabytes of somebody else's libraries.
build/
dist/
dist-installer/
out/
symbols/
*.obj
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk

# Libraries fetched or built on this machine, about 4 GB of them.
# The README says how to get each one back.
third_party/

# Visual Studio and editor leftovers.
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
CMakeSettings.json
CMakeUserPresets.json

# Nothing here should ever hold a token or a password, but these are the
# names such a file usually takes, so they are refused up front.
*.log
session.dat
*.ini
secrets*
.env

# wrangler's local cache; it holds the Cloudflare account id and nothing this repo needs
site/.wrangler/
